  "about_item": [
    "Upgrade to 304 Stainless Steel: Tired of flimsy silicone pads that can be chewed apart? Our stainless steel licking mat offers superior chew-resistance for determined chewers. Its non-porous surface wipes clean effortlessly and resists stains and odors, promoting a more hygienic feeding experience",
    "Anxiety Soother & Slow Feeder: Licking is a natural way to help your pet unwind and beat boredom, giving their brain a gentle workout at the same time. And by slowing down their mealtime, it can also be kind to their tummy. It's even a happy little helper for keeping them focused during tricky moments like baths or nail trims!",
    "3 Separate Zones for Variety: 3 unique textured zones keep your pup curious and engaged by offering fun sensory variety—perfect for mental stimulation and interactive enrichment. And they're great for holding treats like peanut butter, yogurt, or wet food. For an extra fun twist, just freeze it beforehand and give your pup a cool, refreshing snack",
    "Stays Put with 59 Suction Cups: Featuring strong silicone suction cups on the base, this licking mat adheres securely to most smooth surfaces. On the floor like tile, it prevents your \"food bulldozer\" from pushing it around during excited mealtimes. On vertical surfaces like glass, it holds on for the long haul, creating a fun, space-saving feeding challenge. No more chasing a sliding bowl",
    "One Mat, Large Size for All Pets: Measuring 9.57\" x 9.57\" x 0.69\", weighs 400g, and is made from sturdy, long-lasting stainless steel is perfect for all dogs and cats. 5mm raised ridges that help hold snacks while making licking easy and fun"
  ],
